From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:57:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_DEBUG=gpu logs GPU time, frames and present waits
 each second

To tell a GPU-bound frame from a CPU-bound one on the phone there was
no number: the [kk-queue] lines give the GPU time of the first 40
command buffers only. With MESA_KK_DEBUG=gpu, about once a second a
[kk-gpu] line sums the interval:

- gpu: each completed command buffer's GPUEndTime - GPUStartTime, from
  the commit feedback handlers the queue already installs; busy: the
  same with overlapping command buffers counted once, and its share of
  the interval; cbs: how many completed;
- frames and fps: submits that present a drawable; gpu/frame: busy over
  frames;
- acquire: time the presenting threads spent in the layer's nextDrawable
  (wsi_metal_acquire_wait_ns), present-wait: in vkWaitForPresentKHR
  (wsi_metal_present_wait_ns), both totals the Metal WSI keeps;
- submit: CPU time in the driver's queue submit, re-recording included.
  Command encoding happens in the application's recording calls and is
  not counted.

The interval is closed by the first submit a second after it opened, so
an idle second is folded into the next line; the queue's end logs the
last interval as "final". One process-wide record under a mutex:
completion handlers run on Metal's threads. Off unless the flag is set;
the dev app sets it (MESA_KK_DEBUG=compile,memory,gpu), the release app
none. The host test runs three buffer copies in a child with the flag
and finds gpu=6.0 ms busy=6.0 ms cbs=3 in the final line (the mock now
gives each command buffer 2 ms of GPU time).

Linear: PLA-364
Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-20-rdr2-perf-ports.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c       |   1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h       |   4 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_queue.c       | 113 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_metal.c       |  24 ++++-
 src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_metal_layer.h |   6 ++
 5 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index 588831e..d85f2fd 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value debug_flags[] = {
    {"memory", KK_DEBUG_MEMORY},
    {"unroll_hints", KK_DEBUG_UNROLL_HINTS},
    {"no_known_fail", KK_DEBUG_NO_KNOWN_FAIL},
+   {"gpu", KK_DEBUG_GPU},
